            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu biro by'okutegyeka kw'abaramuzi, hakabaho enjara omu nsi. Omushaija wa Betelehemu-Yuda yaashuhuukira omu nsi ya Moabu, we n'omukazi we n'abatabani bombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo mushaija akaba naayetwa Elimeleki, n'omukazi we naayetwa Naomi, n'amaziina g'abatabani gakaba gari Mahalooni na Kilioni; bakaba bari aba Efuraata, aba Betelehemu-Yuda. Ku baahikire omu nsi ya Moabu, baatuurayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Elimeleki iba wa Naomi yaafa; Naomi yaatsigara n'abatabani bombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baashwera Abamoabukazi, omwe akaba naayetwa Orupa, n'ondi Ruusi; baamarayo emyaka nka ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Mahalooni na Kilioni bombi baafa; Naomi ogwo yaafeerwa iba n'abatabani bombi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
