              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Batyo baagumizamu bombi okuhitsya obu baahikire Betelehemu. Ku baahikireyo, ab'omu rurembo boona baajagarara ahabwabo, abakazi baabuuzana bati: Beitu ogu ni Naomi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.19",
